Z||000000||ThatRickGuy||05-22-2001||02:34 PM||||I can understand being anti-rice and all, heck, I think stickered up cars look stupid, but this really got my goat! I was pulling up to a stop light in Springfield, VA (arround 11:30pm a few nights ago) and a silverish car pulls up next to me in the left turn lane. It was a nice night out, so I had my window down and I heard the guys laughing. When I looked over the passanger saw me and said "nice formula" while snikering. It didn't even strike me that they were making fun of what they thought was rice until later on the ride.&lt;rant&gt; All I have to say is don't make fun of a car's sticker if it's supose to be there!!!&lt;/rant&gt;||||reg||1
