Z||000004||TwisT||05-22-2001||10:45 PM||||MUCH RESPECT....<P>To none!  <P>Ha!  Honestly,  "rice" has become less of a food and more of and excuse to boost an ego.  None the less,   we're all in the same gang here...  we love cars (for whatever reason)  and love them thoroughly.  We as Fiero owners respect our sports-cars with immense pride,  and frown apon any wanna-be's that infringe upon our sports-car bloodline.<P>Four-doors aren't cool...<P>Rice-cakes aren't cool...<P>Big body-hugging stickers aren't cool...<P>Let us burn-one down and relax tho...  We are Fiero owner's who aren't in it for the bashing.  We're here because we love our Italian-like cars,  appreciative of it's down and up-sides.<P>"Rice" is a term now used for over-banged imports.  Fieros are not imports.  Maybe we should compare Fieros to Fieros.  Imports are imports.  American muscle is American muscle.  Anyone that is here to compare Mustangs and Camaros to Fieros is either equiped with a V8 or turbo,  super-charged V6.  Otherwise,  "rice" is left to the one's who are too stoned to know better,  or too rich to care if they spend their dough on a 4-bangin' rice-rocket from hell.<P>To each his own,  from the Carribean phool...<P>Mr. Stoner,<P>TwisT<P>   <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/italbanner3.JPG">  <P><p>[This message has been edited by TwisT (edited 05-22-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||Ken Wittlief||05-22-2001||11:49 PM||||well hold on for a second now - this thought had crossed my mind before<P>arnt Formula Racers a specific type of racing car - dont they run on nitro-methane or some other alcohol fuel? isnt that what the 'Formula' in formula-racer means?<P> if not then it must mean something<P>and in that respect, a street production car isnt really a Formula car, right?<P> maybe thats what they were snickering about.||||reg||1
Z||000006||MikeSchaefer||05-23-2001||12:20 AM||||I think that formula is just a model name that signifies one of the nicest fieros made.  Not a way of trying to make someone think you are running nitrous.  These yokels are obviously laughable themselves, so next time just hammer them into the ground.<BR>Later,<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||2
